Why vendored
------------
The web UI is a single self-contained binary with no run-time dependency on a
content network (spec 002-map-view, FR-018), so a hosted font stylesheet is not
an option. These files are embedded by the //go:embed assets/static/* directive
in internal/web/server.go and loaded by @font-face in app.css.

The Latin subset covers U+0000-00FF plus common punctuation, which includes the
accented letters GPX files routinely carry in names (é, ï, ...). Characters
outside it fall back to the system sans.
